<view class="pageDemo"><mx-nav title="水印" /><view style="height:{{navHeight}}px;"></view><view class="demoIntro"><desc type="name" text="WaterMark">WaterMark</desc><desc>页面或局部区域的水印，支持文字、多行文案与图片水印</desc></view><wrap><title type="h2">基础文字水印</title><desc type="prop" text="content">content</desc><desc type="prop" text="fullPage">fullPage="{{false}}"</desc><view class="cons"><mx-water-mark content="MXWUI" fullPage="{{false}}"><view class="panel"><view class="panelTitle">局部水印</view><view class="panelText">水印仅覆盖当前内容区域，不影响页面其他部分。</view></view></mx-water-mark></view></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">多行文案</title><desc type="prop" text="content">content 支持数组</desc><view class="cons"><mx-water-mark content="{{multiContent}}" fullPage="{{false}}" gapY="{{56}}"><view class="panel panelTall"><view class="panelTitle">多行水印</view><view class="panelText">content 传入字符串数组时可展示多行水印文案。</view></view></mx-water-mark></view></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">自定义样式</title><desc type="prop" text="fontColor">fontColor</desc><desc type="prop" text="fontSize">fontSize</desc><desc type="prop" text="rotate">rotate</desc><desc type="prop" text="gapX / gapY">gapX / gapY</desc><view class="cons"><mx-water-mark content="机密" fullPage="{{false}}" fontColor="rgba(202, 14, 45, 0.18)" fontSize="{{16}}" fontWeight="bold" rotate="{{-30}}" gapX="{{32}}" gapY="{{64}}" width="{{140}}" height="{{72}}" ><view class="panel panelTheme"><view class="panelTitle">主题色水印</view><view class="panelText">可自定义颜色、字号、字重、旋转角度与间距。</view></view></mx-water-mark></view></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">图片水印</title><desc type="prop" text="image">image</desc><desc type="prop" text="imageWidth / imageHeight">imageWidth / imageHeight</desc><desc type="prop" text="opacity">opacity</desc><view class="cons"><mx-water-mark image="https://cdn.mingsixue.com/xcx/MXWUI/mxwui.png" fullPage="{{false}}" imageWidth="{{64}}" imageHeight="{{32}}" width="{{64}}" height="{{32}}" gapX="{{40}}" gapY="{{40}}" rotate="{{-18}}" opacity="{{0.2}}" ><view class="panel panelTall"><view class="panelTitle">图片水印</view><view class="panelText">传入 image 后优先展示图片水印，可通过 opacity 控制透明度。</view></view></mx-water-mark></view></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">全屏水印</title><desc type="prop" text="fullPage">fullPage 默认 true</desc><view class="cons"><view class="panel tip"><view class="panelTitle">页面级水印</view><view class="panelText">本页底部已放置全屏水印示例，滚动查看覆盖效果。实际业务中可直接挂在页面根节点。</view></view></view></wrap><line /><mx-water-mark content="MXWUI 全屏水印" fullPage="{{true}}" fontColor="rgba(4, 10, 35, 0.08)" zIndex="{{8}}" /><prop-table dataSource="{{propDocs}}" /></view> 